#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-managed-resources.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost desktop app supports managed resources. A managed resource"
" can be any service available on the same hostname using the same "
"protocol as the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-managed-resources.rst:10
msgid ""
"Using this feature requires a `custom build of the Mattermost desktop app"
" </deployment-guide/desktop/distribute-a-custom-desktop-app>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-managed-resources.rst:12
msgid ""
"Add the path of a managed resource to your configuration file. When "
"selected, it opens as a pop-up window in the Mattermost desktop app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-managed-resources.rst:14
msgid ""
"In addition to customizing the Mattermost Desktop App, the :ref:`Managed "
"Resource Paths <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-"
"settings:managed resource paths>` setting on the Mattermost server must "
"be configured."
msgstr ""

